      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POST-SEASON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Post-season refers to the period after the regular season in college football, including bowl games and championships."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;#1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"#1 refers to the top-ranked team in the pre-championship rankings."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;#2&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"#2 refers to the second-ranked team in the pre-championship rankings."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOURTH DOWN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fourth down is a term used in American football referring to the fourth attempt to gain ten yards or more on a drive."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;END ZONE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"End zone is the area at either end of the football field where a touchdown is scored."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GOAL LINE STAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Goal line stand is a defensive stand where a team stops the opposing team from scoring a touchdown on the goal line."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOURTH DOWN AND A FOOT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fourth down and a foot refers to the situation where a team is on the fourth down with just a few inches needed to gain the necessary yardage."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NCAA DIVISION III FOOTBALL CHAMPIONSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"NCAA Division III Football Championship is the event that determines the national champion in Division III college football."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0265-ca2ee735f0cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NCAA DIVISION III FOOTBALL CHAMPIONSHIP PLAYOFFS&quot;">
